## Project Structure

```
src/
├── core/           # Pure logic - NO I/O imports
│   └── ...         # @pre/@post required, doctests required
│
└── shell/          # I/O operations
    └── ...         # Returns Result[T, E], calls core/ for logic
```

**Import rule:** Shell imports Core. Core never imports Shell.

